        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A heartfelt action-adventure about courage, friendship, and inner fire.</strong><br>Explore vibrant islands, battle mythic beasts, uncover ancient secrets, and relight the lost Virtues of the world — as Mauri, an unlikely walrus hero.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/9770da1830d1939217f0d2170fb17dae.poster.avif?t=1773848240\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/9770da1830d1939217f0d2170fb17dae.webm?t=1773848240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/9770da1830d1939217f0d2170fb17dae.mp4?t=1773848240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🦭 A WALRUS HERO. A BROKEN WORLD. A FIRE THAT MUST BE LIT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, the world was guided by ancient Virtues — Courage, Justice, Temperance, and Wisdom.<br>Now those fires are fading… and something dark is stirring beneath the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a carefree night out, Mauri’s best friend Touko vanishes without a trace. That same night, Mauri is visited by a powerful vision: the Wise Walrus Wizards appear to him in a dream, warning of the Black Tusks — a mad cult spreading across the Walrus Islands, twisting minds, hoarding power, and hunting the legendary Secret Walrus Fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mauri, a curious, stubborn, big-hearted walrus who never asked to be a hero — but may be the only one left who can become one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/55f1767ed171b7db011a1a517dfdf46a.avif?t=1773848240\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious islands, help strange and unforgettable creatures, battle towering bosses, and uncover ancient secrets in a humorous, tongue-in-cheek 3D action-platform adventure with light RPG elements. Expect lively NPCs, meaningful quests, hidden paths, collectibles, and secrets everywhere — all wrapped in a warm, nostalgic style inspired by classic adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the jokes and charm lies a heartfelt journey about friendship, responsibility, and choosing who you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/303625ca6aecb9c9089af1c157d7b87d.avif?t=1773848240\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌍 EXPLORE A HAND-CRAFTED WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Freely explore beautiful, stylized islands full of secrets<br>• Discover hidden caves, ancient temples, forgotten ruins, and dreamlike locations<br>• Every island has its own culture, creatures, mysteries, and tone<br>• Optional paths, secret areas, and rewarding exploration everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world designed to reward curiosity, not rush you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ DYNAMIC COMBAT &amp; EPIC BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast, responsive third-person combat<br>• Melee, magic and movement-based attacks<br>• Large Boss fights inspired by classic adventure games<br>• Each boss represents a lost Virtue: Wisdom, Temperance, Courage, Justice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses aren’t just enemies — they’re characters with history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/7b17d2253fa46b5ae45b2a64e49a84c9.poster.avif?t=1773848240\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/7b17d2253fa46b5ae45b2a64e49a84c9.webm?t=1773848240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/7b17d2253fa46b5ae45b2a64e49a84c9.mp4?t=1773848240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 QUESTS, PUZZLES &amp; ODD JOBS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Main quests, side quests, and secrets<br>• Environmental puzzles and platforming challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Funny, touching, and sometimes absurd NPC stories<br>• Multiple optional activities and a bar arcade mini-game &quot;Trippy Bottle&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some quests are heroic.<br>Some are silly.<br>Some are… unexpectedly emotional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎩 PROGRESSION, COLLECTIBLES &amp; SECRETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect items, hats, sea shells, vinyl records, and secret hidden ancient shards<br>• Level up, unlock powers and a powerful end-game reward<br>• Tons of secrets, hidden achievements, and Easter eggs<br>• Completionists will have a lot to chew on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play casually — or dive deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tongue-in-cheek 3D action-platformer with RPG flavor, quirky NPCs, rewarding quests, hidden secrets, and fluid combat that values movement, timing, and choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/b5d54b2eacfd5b6482adff4f1a42830c.avif?t=1773848240\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features at a glance:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦭 Play as Mauri, a lazy walrus hero with a heart of gold<br>🌍 Explore hand-crafted islands and their towns full of secrets<br>⚔️ Fluid, positioning-based combat inspired by classic open-world adventures<br>🧩 Quests, puzzles, and memorable and funny NPCs<br>🎩 Collectibles, leveling up, and hidden secrets to find<br>🔥 A heartfelt story beneath the humor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/b21146420494da985eca80cc13be031d.poster.avif?t=1773848240\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/b21146420494da985eca80cc13be031d.webm?t=1773848240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/b21146420494da985eca80cc13be031d.mp4?t=1773848240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
